        ))));
    }
    batch.commit()?;
    Ok(())
}

/// Atomically issues the next artifact sequence and persists the
/// stamped artifact in a single `fjall::OwnedWriteBatch`.
fn issue_artifact(
    journal: &FjallJournal,
    artifact: AcceptedArtifact,
    policy: RuntimePolicy,
